{"id":"07013","root":"uni07013_1","name":{"ja":"アンブローズ","en":"Ambrose"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"アンブローズ","en":"Ambrose"},"element":"Devilish","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2021-09-01","limited":true,"characterId":295,"profile":{"ja":"高い能力を持ち、あくなき美を追求する淫魔インキュバス。男性の精気を吸って生きるサキュバスに対し、インキュバスは女性の精気を吸って生きるため、美男の姿をしている者が多い。アンブローズも優れた容貌と肉体美で人間の女たちを虜にする優秀なインキュバスだったが、さらなる美を求め、ストイックに自分を磨き続けるうちに、だんだんと性別の壁を超えるようになっていった。現在では自らの美を磨くかたわら、“趣味”と称して男女を問わず美しさをプロデュースしたりしている。","en":"He is a high-ability, lustful demon Incubus who ceaselessly pursues beauty. While Succubi live by sucking the energy of men, Incubi live by sucking the energy of women, which is why many of them have the appearance of beautiful men. Ambrose was also an excellent Incubus who captivated human women with his exceptional looks and physical beauty, but as he sought even greater beauty and strictly honed himself, he gradually transcended the boundaries of gender. Now, while polishing his own beauty, he also \"produces\" beauty in men and women alike, calling it his \"hobby\"."},"illustrator":"三澤螢","voiceActor":"百園シューイチ","forms":[{"id":"uni07013_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1058,2116],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[188,376],"def":[121,242],"spd":[75,75],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":41,"skills":["2","1190001"],"evolve":[["evo00004",50],["evo00005",25],["evo00006",25],["evo00023",30],["evo00019",10]]},{"id":"uni07013_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1566,3132],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[307,614],"def":[173,346],"spd":[75,75],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":41,"skills":["2","1190001","1190002"],"evolve":[["evo00016",10],["evo00017",5],["evo00023",50],["evo00019",30],["evo01012",10]]},{"id":"uni07013_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[2074,4151],"sp":[330,330],"atk":[428,857],"def":[227,452],"spd":[75,75],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":41,"skills":["2","1190001","1190002","1190003"]}],"skills":{"2":{"slot":"attack